```Keep only IPs or domains that appear in BOTH the IOC list and the traffic log.```
(source="iocs.csv" OR source="traffic.csv")
| eval indicator=coalesce(ioc, dest_ip, dest_domain)
| stats values(source) AS sources values(computer_name) AS machines values(user_agent) AS user_agents min(_time) AS first_seen max(_time) AS last_seen BY indicator
| where mvcount(sources) > 1
| convert ctime(first_seen) ctime(last_seen)
| table indicator machines user_agents first_seen last_seen
